<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">Titas</book>
  <para style="h">Titas</para>
  <para style="toc1">Titas</para>
  <para style="toc2">Titas</para>
  <para style="mt">Titas</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Pathian sikha leh Jesu Khrist sawltak, Pathian mitelte, a ginna uh lamtou ding leh Pathian limsakna toh kithuah thutak theisak ding a sem in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />huai tangtawn hinna lametna a kinga, Pathian zuaugen theilou in khovel omma a a chiam ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh amah huntak ah thugenna zang in a thu a hihlangta, huai thugenna Pathian i Hondampa thupiak bangzel a kepsak ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Titas, ginna kibang a keimah tapa kiang ah: Pathian leh Khrist Jesu i Hondampa kiang a kipan hehpihna, zahngaihna leh lemna om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hiaiziakin ahi huai Kret tuikulha nang k’on nutsiat, thilhih zohlouhte na hihzoh theihna ding leh thu k’on piak bang a, khua teng a upate na seh theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Upa ding gensiatbei, Zi khat nei, tate Pathian gingta, nawpsak bawlluatna lamsanga gensiat lawhlou, dan banglou a omlou, nei a hih peuhmah uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saptuam heutu Pathian sumkempa a hih ziak in gensiatbei a hih ding ahi; migenhak, lunggam, uain khamhat, mivuak hat, punna nina huaiham mi hi ding hilou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi kipahpih dan siam, hoihlam deih, lungsim diktak, midiktat, misiangthou, kidekthei mi hizaw ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sinsa thuhilhna dik midang sinsakthei leh selhatmite siamlouh tangsak thei ding a sinsaka om thugin muanhuai lenkip mi ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dan banglou a om, thu mawk gengen leh mikhem ching mi tampi, a bikin zeksumte lak a mi a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai mite kam humsak ding ahi, punna nin deih ziak a thuhilhlouh ding hilh in, mite a inkuan kuan un a pisia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amau lak a mi a zawlnei khat in houh, “Kret tuikulh a mite zuautheite, gamsa giloute, thadah, anhaite ahi uh” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hiai theihpihna a dik ahi. Huaiziak in ginna a a dik theihna ding un leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judate tangthu phuahtawmte a kisubuailou ding leh thutak nungngatsan nakte thupiak a limsaklouhna ding un naktakin taihilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Misiangthoute ading in bangkim a siangthou hi; himahleh mi nin leh gingloute ading in siangthou a omkei hi, a lungsim uh a sialehpha theihna uh leng a nin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian thei a kichi ua, himahleh a thilhih un a nawlkhin nak uhi, kihhuaite, thumangloute, thil hoih sepding peuhmah a Pathian deihlouhte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang zaw thuhilhna hoih toh kituak thugen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Putekte kidekthei, zahtakhuai, lungsim hoihtak, ginna leh itna leh kuhkalna a diktak hi ding in hanthawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pitekte leng huchibang in, siangthouna toh kimeh, khohei a zahdan siam ding leh heh hatlou, uain hailou, thilhoihte zilsakte hizaw ding in hanthawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nungak deuhte tuh a pasalte uh leh a tate uh it ding leh lungsim hoihtak pu a om ding a a hilhtheihna ding un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian thu gensiat a a omlouhna ding in theisiamtak a kithununthei, beven lou, amau inn sung kem hiathiat, chingkam leh a pasalte thuthu a om ding a a thuhilh theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai bang in, tangvalte lungsim hoihtak pu ding in thuhilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thil bangkim a thil hoih hihlama etton ding in kibawl inla: na thugin sinsakna ah diktatna, chihtakna leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gensiat vuallouh paukamte langsak lechin a leh lam a nang hondemte’n nang tungtang thu a thusia gen ding neilou a a zum theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sikhate, a pute uh sellou a thuthu a om ding leh bangkim a a kipahna ding ua om ding in thuhilh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian i hondampa thuhilhna thu bangkim a a kilawmsak theihna ding un, khut them neilou ding, muanhuai a na hoih tengteng hihlang zaw ding in sinsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mitengteng kiang ah hotdamna hontun in i Pathian hehpihna a hongtungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian limsaklouhna leh khovel duhgawlna tawpsan in, tulai khovel ah kidek leh diktattak leh Pathian limsak in i om ding uh chih theisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lametna kipahhuai, i Pathian thupi leh Hondampa Jesu Khrist thupina kilakna ngak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman tatlekna tengteng lak a kipan in a hontat theihna ding in leh chitel tuam, thil hoih hih a phatuamngai, amah ading a a hih siangthou theihna ding in i sik in a kipeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuneitakin huai thute hilh inla, hanthawn inla, taihilh in. Kuamah in nang hon musit kei uhen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaihawmte leh thuneite nuai a kitahluta thumang ding leh thil hoih chiteng sem ding a mansa a om ding in sinsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kuamah gensiat louh ding dan, vuallemtak a om ding dan, mitengteng lak a thunuailutna chiteng hihlang a, nunnem ding in amaute theikhe thaksak nawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ei leng nidanglai in mihai, thumanglou, khem a om, utna leh kipahna chiteng sem, gilou leh hazat hata om, kihhuai, leh kihawtuahte i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian, i hondampa migitdan leh mihing tung a a itdan a hong kilat lai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Diktatna a i thilhihte ziak hilou, a chitna ziak a pianthakna a sawp in leh Kha Siangthou a thaksakna in eite a hon hondamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huai Kha Siangthou Jesu Khrist i Hondampa ziak in nakpitak in i tung ah a sungbawta hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Huchi a a hehpihna a siamtansaka om in, lametna a tangtawn hinna gouluahte i hihtheihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hiai thugen a dik ahi. Hiai thilte na phut chiltel k’on deih hi, huchi a Pathian gingta sate’n thil hoih hih ding a a pilvan theihna ding un; hiaite mihingte ading in a hoih in a phatuam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh dotna haihuai, khangthu suina, kiselna, danthu a kilaina nungngatsan in; huaite thil phatuamlou leh bangmahlou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ginna tuam neimi zaw khatvei nihvei hilh nung in deih ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchibang mi a lampial in a gilou ahi chih na thei uh, amah mah siamlouh a kitangsak ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Artema hiam, Taikika hiam, na kiang a k’on sawl chiang in, Nikopoli khua ah ka kiang ah hongpai teitei in; hiai mun a phalbi zat ka tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Dansiam, Zenas leh Apollos a zinna ua bangkim a taksap louhna ding un, phatuamngaitak in na panpih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I mite’n leng a taksap khawktakte uh a suktuah theihna ding un, leh gahlou a a omlouhna ding un thil hoih hih a kuhkal ding in zil uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka kiang a om tengteng in chibai a honbuk uhi. Ginna a kei hon itte chibai hon buksak in. Na vek ua kiang ah hehpihna om hen, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
